Subject: [PATCH 5.4 232/658] Bluetooth: btusb: dont call kfree_skb() under spin_lock_irqsave()
Date: Mon, 16 Jan 2023 16:45:20 +0100
Message-Id: <20230116154920.148102072@linuxfoundation.org>
